---
import Brand from './Brand.astro';
---
<footer class="border-t border-line bg-[#f0efe9]"><div class="container-shell grid gap-10 py-12 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr] md:py-16"><div><Brand /><p class="mt-5 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-muted">A thoughtful starting point for businesses exploring relevant commercial introductions. Clear requirements first; no promised outcomes.</p></div><div><h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-muted">Explore</h2><ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm"><li><a class="text-ink-soft no-underline hover:text-brand" href="/how-it-works/">How it works</a></li><li><a class="text-ink-soft no-underline hover:text-brand" href="/for-buyers/">For buyers</a></li><li><a class="text-ink-soft no-underline hover:text-brand" href="/for-suppliers/">For suppliers</a></li><li><a class="text-ink-soft no-underline hover:text-brand" href="/about/">About Proof to Partner</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-muted">Get in touch</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Have a defined requirement or capability to discuss?</p><a class="mt-3 inline-flex font-semibold text-brand-deep underline decoration-[#9cbeb4] underline-offset-4" href="/contact/">Use the enquiry form ↗</a><ul class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm"><li><a class="text-muted no-underline hover:text-ink" href="/privacy/">Privacy policy</a></li><li><a class="text-muted no-underline hover:text-ink" href="/terms/">Terms of use</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="border-t border-line"><div class="container-shell flex flex-col gap-2 py-5 text-xs leading-5 text-muted sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Proof to Partner</span><span>Commercial introductions begin with evidence, context and consent.</span></div></div></footer>